  "description": "Pairs Kronikol.Extensions.ClickHouse with the ClickHouse.Client (HTTP) driver. Adds compile-time driver integration: accurate rows-affected counts for INSERTs (read from the driver's QueryStats, which ClickHouse.Client populates from the X-ClickHouse-Summary response header — its ExecuteNonQuery return value is always 0 for INSERTs) plus typed wrap/DI registration helpers.",
